# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .dockerignore — OnChain Alpha Scanner
#
# Excludes files from the Docker build context to:
#   1. Speed up `docker build` (smaller context sent to daemon)
#   2. Prevent secrets from leaking into the image layer
#   3. Avoid cache busting from irrelevant file changes
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Dependencies (reinstalled fresh inside the container) ────────
node_modules
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── Build output (rebuilt inside container) ──────────────────────
.next
out
build

# ── Git internals ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ── Environment / Secrets — NEVER bake into the image ────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.docker.example

# ── Editor & OS artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
*.pem
Thumbs.db

# ── Docs & planning files (not needed at runtime) ─────────────────
*.md
!README.md
*.txt
*.sql

# ── Test & audit files ────────────────────────────────────────────
test_*.ts
audit_accuracy.ts
scratch/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Dev-only directories ──────────────────────────────────────────
data_collector/
docs/
futures_update_space/
supabase-setup/

# ── Misc build scripts ────────────────────────────────────────────
build-*.ps1
build-*.txt
build-log.txt
